        <div
          style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;"
        >
          <div
            style="position: relative;"
          >
            <input
              placeholder="Search fields…"
              style="padding: 7px 32px 7px 12px; font-size: 13px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); min-width: 220px; font-family: inherit; outline: none;"
              type="search"
              value=""
            />
          </div>
          <button
            style="background: rgb(228, 184, 104); color: rgb(26, 28, 48); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 184, 104); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; padding: 8px 14px; font-size: 14px;"
          >
            Save
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p
        style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-bottom: 12px; line-height: 1.5;"
      >
        Audiobookshelf pairs with your Calibre library as a second content source. Seshat discovers audiobooks via the ABS REST API, syncs them into a per-library discovery DB, and auto-links ebook ↔ audiobook pairs into cross-library "works".
      </p>
      <div
        style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
      >
        <div
          style="min-width: 0px;"
        >
