          </div>
          <div
            style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
          >
            Address Seshat talks to ABS at — used for both the backend REST API and the Dashboard's open-in-ABS link. Leave the advanced override below blank unless your browser hits ABS at a different hostname than the Seshat container does (rare: public DNS vs. Docker network name).
          </div>
          <div
            style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(228, 184, 104); margin-top: 2px; font-style: italic;"
          >
            e.g. http://10.0.10.20:13378
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
        >
          <input
            placeholder="http://10.0.10.20:13378"
            style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 280px;"
            value="http://abs.example.invalid:13378"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div
        style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
      >
        <div
          style="min-width: 0px;"
        >
          <div
            style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(236, 234, 244);"
          >
