              <div
                style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
              >
                Folder CWA watches for auto-import. Ebooks dropped here flow through CWA's conversion + ingest pipeline.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
            >
              <input
                placeholder="/cwa-ingest"
                style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 260px;"
                value=""
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
          >
            <div
              style="min-width: 0px;"
            >
              <div
                style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(236, 234, 244);"
              >
                CWA Inter-Book Delay
              </div>
              <div
                style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
              >
                Minimum gap between successive book drops into the CWA ingest folder. CWA's post-import duplicate scan runs inside its single-threaded web process; overlapping ingests can wedge it until the container restarts. Default 10s covers CWA's stock 5s import-debounce with margin. Set to 0 if you've turned off CWA's 'Enable automatic duplicate scans' (it's then unnecessary). Raise above 10 if you've increased CWA's import-debounce setting.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
            >
              <div
                style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"
              >
                <input
                  max="120"
                  min="0"
                  step="1"
                  style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 80px; text-align: center;"
                  type="number"
                  value="10"
                />
                <span
                  style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160);"
                >
                  seconds
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
          >
            <div
              style="min-width: 0px;"
            >
              <div
                style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(236, 234, 244);"
              >
                Folder Sink Path
              </div>
              <div
                style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
              >
                Destination when Default Sink is set to Folder.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
            >
              <input
                placeholder="/books"
                style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 260px;"
                value=""
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
          >
            <div
              style="min-width: 0px;"
            >
              <div
                style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(236, 234, 244);"
              >
                Staging Path
              </div>
              <div
                style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
              >
                Intermediate folder where newly-grabbed files are copied before review or direct delivery.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
            >
              <input
                placeholder="/staging"
                style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 260px;"
                value=""
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
          >
            <div
              style="min-width: 0px;"
            >
              <div
                style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(236, 234, 244);"
              >
                Review Staging Path
              </div>
              <div
                style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
              >
                Folder that holds books awaiting manual review. Cleared on approval or rejection.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
            >
              <input
                placeholder="/review-staging"
                style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 260px;"
                value=""
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(180px, 320px); align-items: center; padding: 14px 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(46, 48, 72); gap: 6px 16px;"
          >
            <div
              style="min-width: 0px;"
            >
              <div
                style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(236, 234, 244);"
              >
                Emergency Export Path
              </div>
              <div
                style="font-size: 13px; color: rgb(136, 134, 160); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.5;"
              >
                Fallback folder when sink is unreachable.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: flex-end; min-height: 32px;"
            >
              <input
                placeholder="/emergency-books"
                style="padding: 7px 12px; background: rgb(34, 36, 56); border: 1px solid rgb(58, 60, 86); border-radius: 6px; color: rgb(214, 212, 224); font-size: 13px; outline: none; width: 220px;"
                value=""
              />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</DocumentFragment>
`;

